{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_synopsis", "source_sha256": "00262c901e6687b6db3877f5140c621673f5b5854bc61bd576447d6442eb9334", "ja": "このみに新曲披露のセンター公演を持ちかけ\nるプロデューサー。しかしこのみは言葉を濁\nす。それは現実を知るからこそのためらいだ\nったが、プロデューサーの激励を受け、出演\nする決意を固める。輝く景色を見るために。", "zh": "制作人提议让木实担任新曲披露公演的C位。然而木实却含糊其辞。正是因为认清了现实，她才会犹豫不决，但在制作人的激励下，她下定了出演的决心。为了亲眼见证那耀眼的景色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1000_039kon", "source_sha256": "2830bb0497c99ce2de7feccfd02d774eb63543d97c5d3d97da27db10638df6d8", "ja": "みんなーっ！　今日は本当にありがとう！\nこのみお姉さんの新曲、どうだったかしらー！？", "zh": "大家——！今天真的很谢谢你们！\n木实姐姐的新歌，感觉怎么样呀——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "df9a72867a812bd6a92970debb4a7c7e062dc3845153ca21fb76c4ee68a0c0da", "ja": "セクシー！", "zh": "性感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "d35a7ad621f052f6d2f6ec7e06330b9b128f63510c862ce5c43380a538b3e723", "ja": "ウフフ♪\nみんな、うれしい事言ってくれるじゃない！", "zh": "呵呵♪\n大家都说些让人开心的话嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "f440c9f8b995e674e0cc2fcc919389657015f736712d3ccb6c6c998dd5e01a58", "ja": "今回、この曲を歌うにあたって、\nいろいろ……私なりに悩んだりもしたんだけど。", "zh": "这次要唱这首歌，我也……按照自己的方式烦恼了许多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "cc86c5871347218459ebafa93cc1f2d46b5947668d3737cfb1d1621353af8415", "ja": "結果として、よかったと思ってるわ！", "zh": "结果我觉得挺好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "dba81ff367d48286c8807b6b390a95a8efbc34782eaef0df451e8323c58f113d", "ja": "私もまだまだ、成長中って事ね！\nもっともっとアダルティにいくわよー！", "zh": "我也还在不断成长呢！接下来要变得更加成熟——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1006_audience", "source_sha256": "c6aeb206a4a89e6131bb3cc2c4d63dac07c9c6aa2fe96fa90cfd679823e9c610", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "467898860dc4a8ed0c7ebfdb199090287c09dfcf5714763fbc816b3a3cfc4630", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさま！\n……どうだったかしら？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n……感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5da00463f82fdb8ea62e7a43b39b0de979828bf7f0a19ccdb72792e1313ed55a", "ja": "お疲れさまでした、このみさん。\n片時も目が離せない、そんなステージでした。", "zh": "辛苦了，木实小姐。\n这是一场让人片刻都无法移开视线的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "461acdd59f0908b094998fd725289886bae198829f46eaecc3fab2cb3da64387", "ja": "ありがとう！　……ファンのみんなの前で歌って、\n改めて感じたわ。私はまだまだ、成長できるって！", "zh": "谢谢你！　……在粉丝们的面前歌唱，\n让我再次感受到了。我还能继续成长下去呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "1a23c376824cdfc23119908660375800f8dd095ddaef04780014c1dc5f234439", "ja": "だから、満足はしていないの。\nだって私が目指すのは、頂点ですもの！　ウフフ♪", "zh": "所以，我还不能满足。因为我所追求的，是顶点啊！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "9a8a7d5722f1491c8d67c39a9dafa296992553bd1bffe61ec367a60da5124ba6", "ja": "このみ師匠、お疲れさまです！　新曲……\nなんていうか、すっごく雰囲気のあるセクシーでした！", "zh": "木实师父，辛苦了！新歌……该怎么说呢，真的是一首特别有氛围感的性感歌曲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "87a6b2b11585a6c8ca30ddd904a7703ef552ded06a8610e37b013ad583d78635", "ja": "本当に……このみさん、綺麗だなって。\n私も、見とれちゃいました……！", "zh": "真的……我觉得，这次的小此木姐好漂亮啊。\n我也看得入迷了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "b8d0b7b0377131be535b233700672ed3983f4df226f8c33cc00006e0ded25145", "ja": "あら、ありがとう♪　私のセクシー、\nふたりにもバッチリ伝わったみたいね。", "zh": "哎呀，谢谢♪看来我的性感魅力，也完完全全传达给你们两个了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "9a61f6febad17412c174363e6c7d106f41718b33c73e316fe49febd8521b31cd", "ja": "今日のこのみさん、すっごく素敵でした！\n本当に本物の、マーメイドみたいでしたよ♪", "zh": "今天的好美小姐，真是太迷人了！\n真的就像真正的人鱼一样呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "9d93a26c01195f3c86f47d3e44bb724a5f46911ead4ed03addb72f6ec067c5a7", "ja": "麗花お姉ちゃんまでトリコにするとは……\nゆきぴょん、亜美達も負けてられないよ！", "zh": "连丽花姐姐都被你迷住了……\n小雪，我们亚美也不能输哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c1931ef09022299b4d72cf1ef5b5aac055fc663cd0e8943e39afed0c0c4dfe33", "ja": "ええっ、わ、私！？", "zh": "诶诶，我、我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5f0841caed29b5c5f412effd2b827b9a7bc53661b7e51edab9b743ff3683653f", "ja": "盛り上がってるところ悪いけど、みんな、先に\n着替えて来ないと。打ち上げの時間がなくなるぞ？", "zh": "大家正热闹着呢，不好意思，不过得先去换衣服。不然就没时间参加庆功宴了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "7a1bf5eed116c84d118007b383c821826d85ca69ba152b56305912054a98cfd7", "ja": "そうでした！\nそれじゃ、パパッと着替えてきちゃいますね♪", "zh": "对哦！\n那我就赶紧换好衣服回来啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "579f65727fc461e74f65960915d1a99f2444b11f0ee94c97c40042e36214209a", "ja": "待ってよ、麗花お姉ちゃん！\n亜美も行く～！", "zh": "等等我呀，丽花姐姐！\n亚美也去～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "aa4e57aff6a66cd637dae9aa25a9fa38653a766a8207e57cffe958224b26ba67", "ja": "あれ？　このみ師匠は、行かないんですか？", "zh": "咦？这个美师父不去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
