{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1024_p", "source_sha256": "517a0881f9fcf673cb50033385b61fb7fc216e19857a66857d7a9d779013350e", "ja": "はい、もちろん。どうかしましたか？", "zh": "好的，当然可以。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "c3757cc55b748e8e3b4c055e419c673b13009f699cfa9a5dd3d973c425bef62c", "ja": "ええ。やっぱり、言葉にしなきゃダメね。\n……{$P$}、ありがとう。", "zh": "嗯。果然还是得说出来才行呢。\n……{$P$}，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "ab25020b79ddd9506e5a96b814ffc59832b4a9c448d468820b1f4b6413a8a0e7", "ja": "迷っている私の背中を押してくれたり、\n本番前に手を握ってくれたり……。", "zh": "你推着迷茫的我向前迈出一步，在正式演出前握住我的手……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
