{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1028_p", "source_sha256": "34b8a39567493dfe79536df67238388f54becbcceecda0a0a699e73198a1a02f", "ja": "このみさん……こちらこそ。\n最高のステージを、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "这都是因为有你，我才能成为现在的自己。谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
