{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "4975c3933a6b7fc7edf87fe9617d55dcfed5c97543607eb5e773978f77ee6452", "ja": "{$P$}。今日のステージも本当に\n素敵だったけど……私、もっとすごい景色が見たいの。", "zh": "{$P$}。今天的舞台也真的很精彩，不过……我还想看到更加壮丽的景色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_072_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_072_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "b4d73a669777318e282c91112b8a43b92fa5709d53bb2fa03b4fd1888db577b1", "ja": "……私に、ついてきてくれる？", "zh": "……你能，一直跟着我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
